          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental biologics application provides for a new indication for the treatment, in combination with docetaxel, of patients with metastatic non-small cell lung cancer with disease progression on or after platinum-based chemotherapy. Patients with EGFR or ALK genomic tumor aberrations should have disease progression on FDA-approved therapy for these aberrations prior to receiving CYRAMZA.",
