        "description": {
          "text": "Updated Pediatric Use subsection (8.4) with results from pediatric studies to fulfill a Written Request under BPCA (no new indication; label update only)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental biologics license application provides for an update to the USE IN SPECIFIC POPULATIONS section, Subsection 8.4, Pediatric Use, of the Cyramza (ramucirumab) Prescribing Information to include results from pediatric studies J1S-MC-JV01 and J1S-MC-JV02, conducted to fulfill the terms of the Written Request issued on December 16, 2017, and amended on March 21, 2019, March 8, 2022, and August 4, 2023. This sBLA also includes a request to extend applicable regulatory exclusivities for a period of six months in accordance with 21 U.S.C. \u00a7355a, the Best Pharmaceuticals for Children Act (BPCA).",
